        rdfs:comment                   "Silk ribbon with a bold tartan in red, light and dark green, black, white and yellow with a little maroon. The tartan's various stripes and checks are further differentiated by being woven in taffeta, satin, velvet, rib and cannellée. There is a decorative green edging."@en , "Silk ribbon, France, 1840-1865."@en ;
